# OLED55B5PJA, the Japanese 55-inch B5: the models DB lists it for W25H's ARIB firmware
# (HE_DTV_W25H_AFADJAAA, the only W25H queue build; its Japanese models are the OLED B5 alone),
# which boots it by its model_id.json region (targets.Soc.broadcast_boards). From that firmware's
# own generators (queue 43.22.66, host/tools/research/model-config.py): hw-option-gen decodes the
# line as K24N, countryType JP, 2G, OLED, UD, EPI, 120 Hz panel and SoC output (the B5's native
# 120 Hz panel, LG's product specifications), 1920x1080 graphics; nyx-option-gen ARIB. countryGrp
# 18: nyxDeviceInfo's group of the line, configd's JP RMM group (JPN). ToolOpt: LLS's factory
# default record of this line with the B5/55" panelInch and toolType. Identity placeholders are replaced per VM.
ethaddr=02:00:00:12:34:56
devtmpfs.mount=1
countryGrp=18
modelopt=000000000
hwopt=000200010104102000
ToolOpt=68374991:1323030:1673241:65:24782131:1645463051
modelName=OLED55B5PJA
debugMode=3
serialNum=000RAXX00001
chip=K24N
tvregion=ARIB
emmc_size=0x1d2000000
cmdEnd
